OL,3,AAndy Burnham to face Kemi Badenoch at
OL,4,APMQs
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham is set to face
OL,7,FConservative leader Kemi Badenoch at
OL,8,FPMQs - watch live above from midday
OL,10,FIt comes after the latest ONS figures
OL,11,Fshowed the rate of inflation rose to
OL,12,F3.5% from 3.1% in the year to September
OL,13,F- its quickest pace since October 2025
OL,15,FWith the cost of filling up a vehicle
OL,16,Fcontinuing to soar, Chancellor John
OL,17,FHealey has said: "We know that price
OL,18,Frises from conflicts in the Middle East
OL,19,Fand Europe are hitting Britain and
OL,20,Fcountries worldwide"
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
