OL,5,
OL,6,FGovernment borrowing was also found to
OL,7,Fhave risen, jumping to nearly #25bn,
OL,8,Fadding to pressure on Healey ahead of
OL,9,Fhis first Budget next week
OL,11,FAlso on Wednesday, the government
OL,12,Fannounced it was approving extraction
OL,13,Ffrom the Jackdaw gas field - see our
OL,14,Fother live coverage for more
OL,16,FBadenoch has backed the decision but
OL,17,Faccused Labour of spending "two years
OL,18,Ffaffing about"; the Conservatives
OL,19,Fapproved Jackdaw in 2022
